FOR POSTERITY and anyone getting a 400 in the future

I see this as the 'easy' way out. It seems that the serial console on the
400's (unlike the 300) only works on the MMJ connector not the 25pin. The
300 only has the 25 pin and a regular PC serial cable works fine.

I used a double ended MMJ cable (someone called a DEC office) and a 25pin
connector with MMJ socket in back at the PC side. It came right up!
